WEBVTT

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:08.588
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.428 --> 00:00:12.146
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I arrived in Paris on Friday night.

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:14.817
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.736 --> 00:00:18.790
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I was very tired when I arrived at the hotel.

00:00:20.706 --> 00:00:21.529
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:22.441 --> 00:00:25.058
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I hate waiting for people who are late.

00:00:27.016 --> 00:00:27.805
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:31.278
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> What are you going to do at the weekend?

00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:34.096
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> I don’t know. It depends on the weather.

00:00:36.037 --> 00:00:36.951
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:40.633
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m sorry, but I really don’t agree with you.

00:00:42.539 --> 00:00:43.406
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:44.302 --> 00:00:47.579
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I asked for a chicken sandwich, but this is tuna!

00:00:49.456 --> 00:00:50.320
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:51.205 --> 00:00:53.477
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Please listen to what I’m saying!

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:56.144
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:57.061 --> 00:00:58.885
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Who’s going to pay for the meal?

00:01:00.896 --> 00:01:01.714
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:02.591 --> 00:01:05.655
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I need to speak to Martin about the meeting.

00:01:07.511 --> 00:01:08.270
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:09.207 --> 00:01:11.447
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I don’t spend much money on food.

00:01:13.444 --> 00:01:14.297
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 11

00:01:15.194 --> 00:01:16.980
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Don’t worry about the exam.

00:01:17.111 --> 00:01:18.495
It isn’t very hard.

00:01:20.419 --> 00:01:21.327
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 12

00:01:22.196 --> 00:01:24.047
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you believe in ghosts?

00:01:26.014 --> 00:01:27.050
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 13

00:01:27.914 --> 00:01:29.718
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> You’re not listening!

00:01:30.185 --> 00:01:31.948
What are you thinking about?

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:34.907
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 14

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.738
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> What do you think of this painting?

00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:39.601
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> I really like it.

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:41.571
I think it’s beautiful.

00:01:43.555 --> 00:01:44.547
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 15

00:01:45.497 --> 00:01:47.350
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Who does this bag belong to?